# The repository is currently configured for a prelaunch Vercel demo.
# No CMS_URL or other environment variables are needed for the saved snapshot.
# Optional explicit override:
# CONTENT_MODE=demo

# Final launch: set these in the Vercel project environment after hosted CMS,
# domain, public contact details and legal content are approved.
# CONTENT_MODE=wordpress
# CMS_URL=https://your-wordpress-host.example
# SITE_URL=https://your-confirmed-domain.in
# PRODUCTION_LAUNCH=1

# Local WordPress editing: supply CMS_URL in the shell (or use cms:watch).
# CMS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8088
# WEBSITE_URL=http://localhost:4173
# Never put credentials or deploy-hook secrets in VITE_*.
